#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/25mm.json
msgid ""
"The much feared 2519 smart sniper platform leverages advanced ballistic "
"targeting and guidance computers to deliver heavy munitions with unerring "
"precision.  Its undisputed lethality makes it a rare sight outside of the "
"company's max security divisions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
