#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/40mm_grenade.json
msgid ""
"A crude grenade launcher that's been either ripped from a broken robot or "
"built using a hacked template.  The remnants of a loading rack allow it to "
"hold three 40mm grenades at once."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
