msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of gun "direct fusion gun"
#. ~ Description of "direct fusion gun"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/plasma.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/plasma.json
msgid ""
"Exhaust from a salvaged starship engine is channeled through a series of "
"magnetic coils and focused into a searing fan of plasma, creating a crude but"
" effective short range weapon that can easily melt through most forms of "
"armor.  Its makeshift nature and lack of proper cooling systems make it prone"
" to overheating and catastrophic failure."
msgstr ""

