#. ~ Description of variant "m2101-UASTA shotgun" of item "Benelli 315"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/shot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"The standard issue combat shotgun of UICA marine and colonial forces.  Shot "
"shells have poor performance against modern combat armor, so the M2101 is "
"more often used during policing and peacekeeping operations."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/shot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/shot.json
