#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"An advanced shotgun that combines chemical and electromagnetic propulsion "
"systems to accelerate and focus a cloud of steel flechettes.  Resulting in a "
"longer effective range and greater penetration than whats conventionally "
"possible.  Most often deployed during low-intensity corporate conflicts."
msgstr ""

