#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/shot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A massive TSKBEM-design shotgun intended for exosuit forces, the Raketa aka "
"'Rocket' is a magazine-fed bullpup shotgun featuring twin barrels.  This "
"design remains popular for extra-atmospheric operations as the 12ga rounds "
"are less likely to pierce a ship or station's delicate hull."
msgstr ""

