#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gunmods/ETC_firmware.json
msgid ""
"Custom firmware for the electrical ignition system of caseless firearms.  "
"Increases the potency of the heat ignition system, causing bullets to melt "
"and be subsequently fired as globules of superheated metal.  The projectiles "
